  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math> such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>&#947;</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8469;</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given differential equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IF</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>The required equation will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now using, at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now finding the value of function at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now on comparing we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence, this is the required answer.</p></blockquote>",
